# The top of level $0A's climb: its task ($81:A30D) puts the player's
# sprites in front near the top ($81:A327, the player's y under 256),
# and once the camera is at the top and the player at x 128 or more and
# y under 120 ($81:A337, $81:A345) it changes the colour math, then waits
# for the camera to reach x 256 ($81:A370). The scripts' play stays at
# the climb's foot. As in cov_level_ends.box, the player and the camera
# are placed (pokes of the player's X $08E7, Y $08EA and the camera
# $1773, $1777 with its last position $19E5, $19E9); then the game runs
# on.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s2.state
wait 30
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 0008E7 90,00
poke 0008EA 70,00
wait 30
poke 001773 00,01
poke 0019E5 00,01
poke 0008E7 80,01
wait 30
